@file AGENTS.md

## AGENTS.md rules

- AGENTS.md files are **merged**, not replaced.
- For any file you work on:
  - Read `AGENTS.md` in that file’s directory (if present).
  - Walk upward to the repo root and read every `AGENTS.md` found.
- Apply **all** instructions together.

### Conflicts

- Instructions are additive by default.
- If two instructions conflict, the **closest (deepest) directory wins**, but only for that conflict.
- All other instructions remain in effect.

AGENTS.md instructions override Cursor defaults and other rules.
